initi. We took the Q50 hybrid RWD to the test.\n"},{"title":"Perfect Ride - Parking Wars","start":"20/10/2025 11:30","end":"20/10/2025 12:00","stop":"20/10/2025 12:00","desc":" · Tests · Not only in the big cities it's a growing struggle for parking spots. . We took the BMW X6, the Citroen Cactus and the Smart forfour to town in order to find out how these cars would cope in this situation and surrounding.\n"},{"title":"Perfect Ride - Rear-wheel drive for everyone","start":"20/10/2025 12:00","end":"20/10/2025 12:30","stop":"20/10/2025 12:30","desc":" · Tests · Cars with a rear-wheel drive are usually considered to be agile but also a bit capricious in regards to their handling. Does this also apply to the Porsche GT3 and the Smart? In addition: the sporty midsize sedan model range, BMW's 3 Series.\n"},{"title":"The Dubai Police Force's Special Cars Unit","start":"20/10/2025 12:30","end":"20/10/2025 12:45","stop":"20/10/2025 12:45","desc":" · Luxury · The extraordinary Dubai Police special cars unit.\n"},{"title":"Beradino","start":"20/10/2025 12:45","end":"20/10/2025 13:00","stop":"20/10/2025 13:00","desc":" · Classic · The Beradino, a unique hand-crafted sports car.\n"},{"title":"Motorstories - Chevrolet Chevelle und Down Town Garage","start":"20/10/2025 13:00","end":"20/10/2025 13:30","stop":"20/10/2025 13:30","desc":" · People · Kati and Patrick from Munich are no longer satisfied with their 1972 Chevrolet Chevelle's 5.7-liter small block and want to buy a bigger engine. For that reason they visit the engine specialists from Down Town Garage for a proper conversion.\n"},{"title":"Motorstories - Oldtimer Show and Race at Airport","start":"20/10/2025 13:30","end":"20/10/2025 14:15","stop":"20/10/2025 14:15","desc":" · People · Paaren/Glien near Berlin is host to the yearly Oldtimer Show. Frank and his crew from Special Cars Berlin take their Dragster Camaro to the airfield where high performance cars battle it out in a 1/8 mile race. Will Frank be able to defy the competition?\n"},{"title":"Motorstories - Germany's Supercars Rallye","start":"20/10/2025 14:15","end":"20/10/2025 14:45","stop":"20/10/2025 14:45","desc":" · People · With more than 500 featured super sports cars by Lamborghini, Ferrari, Bugatti or Koenigsegg, Germany is home to the world's largest Supercar Rallye. US car fans Kati and her husband Patrick take part in this event with a brand new Chevrolet Camaro.\n"},{"title":"Porsche Ruf RT35","start":"20/10/2025 14:45","end":"20/10/2025 15:00","stop":"20/10/2025 15:00","desc":" · Luxury · O Ruf RT35 pode parecer-se com um Porsche, mas não é\n"},{"title":"4x4 - All- Wheel- Drive on station wagons","start":"20/10/2025 15:00","end":"20/10/2025 15:30","stop":"20/10/2025 15:30","desc":" · Offroad · The Skoda Octavia, the Opel Insignia Country Tourer, the Subaru Outback, the Audi S4 allroad quattro and the Seat Leon x-perience want to be more than roomy family cars. Their offroad features show that it doesn't always have to be an SUV.\n"},{"title":"4x4 - Extreme offroad cars","start":"20/10/2025 15:30","end":"20/10/2025 16:00","stop":"20/10/2025 16:00","desc":" · Offroad · We present some of the more extreme specimens in the offroad world: a Fiat Panda monster truck, a Ford Raptor, a conversion of a Mercedes G-class Edition, a modified Volkswagen Touareg, a Jeep Grand Cherokee SRT8 and the Fiat Panda Cross.\n"},{"title":"4x4 - Compact SUVs from the Far East","start":"20/10/2025 16:00","end":"20/10/2025 16:30","stop":"20/10/2025 16:30","desc":" · Offroad · With its extravagant design the Lexus NX200t definitely stands out. Infiniti, Nissan's luxury division, is more conservative in that regard. The QX30 features a classic Infiniti design with a curved bonnet. Also: the city SUV Mazda CX-3.\n"},{"title":"4x4 - SUV Brothers","start":"20/10/2025 16:30","end":"20/10/2025 17:00","stop":"20/10/2025 17:00","desc":" · Offroad · Three brothers from the same Volkswagen production platform: the Skoda Kodiaq provides room for seven people, the Volkswagen Tiguan is a bit more expensive but offers a broader range of engines, and Seat infuse the SUV segment with Spanish passion.\n"},{"title":"4x4 - Business Class with All-Wheel Drive","start":"20/10/2025 17:00","end":"20/10/2025 17:30","stop":"20/10/2025 17:30","desc":" · Offroad · The Jaguar XF-S is supposed to put pressure on BMW, Audi and the other competitors in the business class segment. Volvo take a different approach. Their S90 is captivating due to its Scandinavian design and economical four-cylinder engines.\n"},{"title":"4x4 - ORZ","start":"20/10/2025 17:30","end":"20/10/2025 18:00","stop":"20/10/2025 18:00","desc":" · Offroad · ORZ Vehicles, a German company specializing in the production, sale and installation of Jeep parts and accessories, makes the American off-road dream come true. A good example for this approach is the Brute, a pickup version of the Wrangler.\n"},{"title":"4x4 - Compact and Mini SUVs","start":"20/10/2025 18:00","end":"20/10/2025 18:30","stop":"20/10/2025 18:30","desc":" · Offroad · The Seat Arona is a typical compact or mini SUV. Another pseudo off-roader is the Volkswagen T-Roc. Can the smallest Volkswagen SUV repeat the success of the best-selling Tiguan? Also: the Asian competitors Hyundai Kona, KIA Stonic and Toyota C-HR.\n"},{"title":"BMW F 800 R","start":"20/10/2025 18:30","end":"20/10/2025 18:45","stop":"20/10/2025 18:45","desc":" · Motorcycles · The agile and robust roadster BMW F 800 R.\n"},{"title":"Audi MTM S8 Talladega R","start":"20/10/2025 18:45","end":"20/10/2025 19:00","stop":"20/10/2025 19:00","desc":" · Luxury · Audi MTM S8 Talladega\n"},{"title":"Car History - The Story of Automotive Advertising, Part 1","start":"20/10/2025 19:00","end":"20/10/2025 19:30","stop":"20/10/2025 19:30","desc":" · History · No consumer good is fought over as fiercely and as cost-intensively as the car. No sooner had the first car been launched in 1886 than advertising began touting the great benefits of the motor car for mankind. Part 1 of 3.\n"},{"title":"Car History - The Story of Automotive Advertising, Part 2","start":"20/10/2025 19:30","end":"20/10/2025 20:00","stop":"20/10/2025 20:00","desc":" · History · In the 1970s and 80s, car production booms and with it car advertising. Television advertising for cars picks up speed. Even the oil crisis cannot stop worldwide car production or the corresponding advertising. Part 2 of 3.\n"},{"title":"Car History - The Story of Automotive Advertising, Part 3","start":"20/10/2025 20:00","end":"20/10/2025 20:45","stop":"20/10/2025 20:45","desc":" · History · In no other industry is marketing as important as in the automotive industry. Brands, models and advertising campaigns have been closely intertwined for decades. How has car advertising developed since the 1990s? Part 3 of 3.\n"},{"title":"Car History - Chevrolet Corvette","start":"20/10/2025 20:45","end":"20/10/2025 21:15","stop":"20/10/2025 21:15","desc":" · History · The Chevrolet Corvette is the best-selling sports car in the world. It belongs to the USA like the Statue of Liberty, the Superbowl and John Wayne. Since its market launch the Corvette has developed into an automotive icon.\n"},{"title":"Car History - Chevrolet Corvette and Porsche 911","start":"20/10/2025 21:15","end":"20/10/2025 21:45","stop":"20/10/2025 21:45","desc":" · History · 50 years of Porsche 911, 60 years of Chevrolet Corvette: two legends, two myths, two dream cars, and two philosophies. The Porsche 911 and the Chevrolet Corvette are the sports car icons in Europe and the USA.\n"},{"title":"Wanderer Stromlinie Spezial","start":"20/10/2025 21:45","end":"20/10/2025 22:00","stop":"20/10/2025 22:00","desc":" · Classic · The Wanderer Werke and their Stromlinie Spezial car.\n"},{"title":"Classic Races - The 1994 Indy 500","start":"20/10/2025 22:00","end":"20/10/2025 22:30","stop":"20/10/2025 22:30","desc":" · History · The Indy 500 is one of the most spectacular racing events in the world. More than 400.000 spectators watch this mixture of show and motorsports competition at the Indianapolis Motor Speedway each year. We take a look back at the 1994 Indy 500.\n"},{"title":"Classic Races - Deutsche Rallye Meisterschaft 1983","start":"20/10/2025 22:30","end":"20/10/2025 23:00","stop":"20/10/2025 23:00","desc":" · History · Since its premiere in 1970 the Deutsche Rallye Meisterschaft has been one of the most popular motorsports series. In the 1983 competition Opel's Manta, Kadett and Ascona sports models celebrated exceptional successes.\n"},{"title":"Classic Races - Audi Quattro - The new Dimension, 1985","start":"20/10/2025 23:00","end":"20/10/2025 23:30","stop":"20/10/2025 23:30","desc":" · History · In 1985 Audi made their impressive mark in motorsports with the Quattro. With its 4x4 drive this model impressed the audience and shocked the competition alike and ushered in a new era in rally sports.\n"},{"title":"Classic Races - Mercedes Races again 1954/55","start":"20/10/2025 23:30","end":"21/10/2025 00:45","stop":"21/10/2025 00:45","desc":" · History · After more than 20 years of abstinence Mercedes-Benz return to the Grand Prix circuit in 1954. With a lot of ambition, the company's advanced engineering and some of the best drivers in the world the Mercedes team aimed for the championship.\n"}]},{"channel":{"id":"PowerSports World","name":"PowerSports World","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/davidmuma/picons_dobleM/master/icon/PowerSports%20World.png"},"programs":[{"title":"Adrenaline Side-by-Sides","start":"20/10/2025 09:00","end":"20/10/2025 10:00","stop":"20/10/2025 10:00","desc":" · Sports · Wheelspin\n"},{"title":"Bret Tkacs","start":"20/10/2025 10:00","end":"20/10/2025 10:30","stop":"20/10/2025 10:30","desc":" · Sports · A look at the latest from Moto Morini Motorcycles.\n"},{"title":"Cafe Racer","start":"20/10/2025 10:30","end":"20/10/2025 11:00","stop":"20/10/2025 11:00","desc":" · Sports · The history and development of the café racer is explored; inc